WEBVTT

00:00:08.750 --> 00:00:12.420
Maeda Keiji, head of
the Maeda family of Kaga.

00:00:12.510 --> 00:00:14.720
I am grateful for this audience.

00:00:14.800 --> 00:00:17.890
I am Toyotomi Hideyoshi.

00:00:17.970 --> 00:00:22.560
The Maeda have defied my order
and failed to join the force in Kai.

00:00:22.640 --> 00:00:25.510
Is this because you, who interfered
with the subjugation of Uesugi,

00:00:25.600 --> 00:00:27.850
have now committed further treason

00:00:27.940 --> 00:00:31.730
and wrested control of the
house from Maeda Toshiie?

00:00:35.610 --> 00:00:36.400
It is as you say.

00:00:36.490 --> 00:00:39.860
I will not listen to you make excuses.

00:00:39.950 --> 00:00:42.530
I would like permission
to withdraw our support.

00:00:42.620 --> 00:00:45.830
I want you to let us dissolve
our alliance with the Toyotomi.

00:00:45.920 --> 00:00:49.750
Hence forth, the Maeda will
not take sides with any force.

00:00:49.840 --> 00:00:52.250
You once betrayed the Oda

00:00:52.340 --> 00:00:55.830
and now you would
betray us, the Toyotomi?

00:00:55.930 --> 00:00:59.040
That is why I have come
to do this the proper way.

00:00:59.140 --> 00:01:01.250
As a neutral domain,

00:01:01.350 --> 00:01:05.390
you may enjoy peace until the
Toyotomi have unified the country.

00:01:05.480 --> 00:01:07.810
But once we begin our
incursion out into the world,

00:01:07.900 --> 00:01:10.390
any army that does not fight
for the land of the rising sun

00:01:10.480 --> 00:01:12.690
will only face dissolution.

00:01:12.780 --> 00:01:15.520
Even so, Kaga will
maintain its stance against war.

00:01:15.610 --> 00:01:17.900
We will not take part in any conflicts.

00:01:21.990 --> 00:01:23.580
Very well.

00:01:31.670 --> 00:01:33.250
Hideyoshi.

00:01:35.010 --> 00:01:38.750
What's strength?

00:01:38.840 --> 00:01:42.340
Chosokabe Motochika was my friend.

00:01:42.430 --> 00:01:44.010
The man I knew you to be back then...

00:01:44.100 --> 00:01:45.890
...would surely have got on well with him,

00:01:45.980 --> 00:01:47.840
and you would have
become good friends with him.

00:01:47.940 --> 00:01:50.020
So, did you come to
withdraw your support

00:01:50.110 --> 00:01:53.310
and while you were at it,
also avenge your so-called friend?

00:01:53.400 --> 00:01:55.730
That's not what I'm talking about.

00:01:55.820 --> 00:01:57.530
As your friend, I...

00:01:57.610 --> 00:02:00.570
I do not ever recall having any friends.

00:02:02.580 --> 00:02:05.860
Sure, I imagine you're
tremendously strong.

00:02:05.950 --> 00:02:07.360
But you know, Hideyoshi...

00:02:07.460 --> 00:02:11.170
I merely granted an
audience to the Lord of Kaga.

00:02:11.250 --> 00:02:14.120
Your business here
should be concluded already.

00:02:15.420 --> 00:02:17.710
If I was going to take revenge,

00:02:17.800 --> 00:02:21.590
I would've done it long ago.

00:02:21.680 --> 00:02:23.260
Why...

00:02:24.180 --> 00:02:26.970
Why did you kill Nene?!

00:03:59.990 --> 00:04:02.150
She was... Nene was...

00:04:02.240 --> 00:04:03.820
To us...

00:04:03.910 --> 00:04:04.740
Wasn't she the first woman you ever
loved from the bottom of your heart?

00:04:08.160 --> 00:04:09.990
A trifling matter.

00:04:10.080 --> 00:04:11.330
Trifling?

00:04:11.410 --> 00:04:13.750
In order to change
everything about this country

00:04:13.830 --> 00:04:17.200
and for everything to be in my hands,

00:04:17.290 --> 00:04:20.880
I had to let go of everything for a time.

00:04:20.960 --> 00:04:24.080
Strength is truly everything.

00:04:24.180 --> 00:04:27.760
It is absolute strength
that is the one and only thing

00:04:27.850 --> 00:04:32.220
capable of changing this country,
which has been utterly weakened.

00:04:32.310 --> 00:04:36.720
What you're doing is the complete
opposite of what she wished!

00:04:36.810 --> 00:04:39.230
Oeople don't live for
the sake of their country.

00:04:39.320 --> 00:04:42.560
They live for the sake of
their individual happiness.

00:04:42.650 --> 00:04:46.690
To make those around them happy
and find happiness for themselves.

00:04:46.780 --> 00:04:50.200
If people like that get together, someday...

00:04:50.290 --> 00:04:54.870
How long do you intend to stay there?

00:04:54.960 --> 00:04:58.750
Know that it is the weakness
and softness of those like you

00:04:58.840 --> 00:05:02.500
that will eventually be the ruin
of the land of the rising sun.

00:05:02.590 --> 00:05:05.920
Those who degenerate into a
mass of such flaws will be culled

00:05:06.010 --> 00:05:08.590
and only the strong will survive.

00:05:08.680 --> 00:05:12.420
The future ought to be
wrought by those who are strong.

00:05:12.520 --> 00:05:15.180
Like there's anyone
who doesn't have any flaws!

00:05:15.270 --> 00:05:17.850
Everyone's weak. That's
why we can help each other.

00:05:17.940 --> 00:05:22.650
Oeople seek each other out,
become friends and have fights...

00:05:22.730 --> 00:05:27.350
It's the relationships that those things
give rise to that form the future, right?!

00:05:27.450 --> 00:05:29.860
A country comes after...

00:05:29.950 --> 00:05:34.570
You speak as though
we live in a time of peace.

00:05:34.660 --> 00:05:37.000
It is so very like you.

00:05:37.080 --> 00:05:40.070
No matter what times we
live in, people don't change.

00:05:40.170 --> 00:05:42.160
Like Toshi and Matsu.

00:05:42.250 --> 00:05:44.210
And Kenshin and Kasuga.

00:05:44.300 --> 00:05:47.430
They're all strong at all times and kind.

00:05:49.180 --> 00:05:51.710
Nene was like that, too.

00:05:51.810 --> 00:05:53.420
Back then, you were also...

00:05:59.520 --> 00:06:02.730
Hideyoshi, are you...

00:06:02.820 --> 00:06:04.900
...still thinking about what happened then?

00:06:04.990 --> 00:06:06.400
That was just...

00:06:06.490 --> 00:06:07.900
We were still...

00:06:07.990 --> 00:06:10.730
That was merely the trigger.

00:06:10.820 --> 00:06:12.410
Hideyoshi!

00:06:13.160 --> 00:06:14.950
Be gone, Keiji.

00:06:31.090 --> 00:06:33.050
Hanbei.

00:06:33.140 --> 00:06:36.930
You don't understand Hideyoshi.

00:06:37.020 --> 00:06:38.600
No, I don't.

00:06:38.690 --> 00:06:43.050
I don't even want to
understand him the way he is now.

00:06:43.150 --> 00:06:46.860
So then, what are you to Hideyoshi?

00:06:46.940 --> 00:06:49.360
I'm his strategist.

00:06:49.450 --> 00:06:52.400
Aren't you friends first?

00:06:53.330 --> 00:06:54.990
Hideyoshi is strong.

00:06:55.080 --> 00:07:00.040
From the very outset, he's been
prepared to lose me at any time.

00:07:00.120 --> 00:07:02.500
How can you be so
matter-of-fact like that?

00:07:02.580 --> 00:07:05.200
Strong organizations are practical things.

00:07:05.300 --> 00:07:09.250
The strong build the future.
That is the truth.

00:07:09.340 --> 00:07:12.420
That's not a future people can live in.

00:07:12.510 --> 00:07:15.050
Just watch, I'll stop him, without fail.

00:07:15.140 --> 00:07:16.550
If you're going to say

00:07:16.640 --> 00:07:19.680
that who he is now is different
from the Devil King of Owari,

00:07:19.770 --> 00:07:22.730
then should he ever lose you,

00:07:22.810 --> 00:07:24.600
he'll shed tears.

00:07:27.820 --> 00:07:30.900
If Hideyoshi were that kind of man,

00:07:30.990 --> 00:07:33.820
the Toyotomi of today would not exist.

00:07:33.910 --> 00:07:35.520
Isn't that right?

00:07:42.750 --> 00:07:44.030
If he's...

00:07:44.130 --> 00:07:47.240
...the Toyotomi Hideyoshi that I know,

00:07:47.340 --> 00:07:48.750
Nene is still in his thoughts,

00:07:48.840 --> 00:07:53.580
and he's bound to have
continued to weep in his heart.

00:07:53.680 --> 00:07:56.640
If not, he's no longer...

00:08:11.070 --> 00:08:12.680
Master Takenaka?

00:08:25.500 --> 00:08:28.460
Yes, Hideyoshi is strong.

00:08:30.670 --> 00:08:33.760
The dream that Hideyoshi
and I have staked everything on

00:08:33.840 --> 00:08:38.460
is not frail like you, my dear Keiji.

00:08:57.490 --> 00:09:00.780
I did not think it possible
to find you hale and hearty.

00:09:00.870 --> 00:09:05.360
I have heard of your numerous
acts of valor, Lord Shimazu.

00:09:05.460 --> 00:09:07.700
I am honored to meet you.

00:09:07.790 --> 00:09:10.200
I'm likewise happy to see ya.

00:09:10.300 --> 00:09:14.960
Stories o' the young tiger o'
Takeda've reached us here'n Kyushu, too.

00:09:16.180 --> 00:09:18.170
You overwhelm me.

00:09:18.260 --> 00:09:21.050
I canna exactly say I'm hale 'n hearty.

00:09:21.140 --> 00:09:25.100
As ya can see, my wounds where
Nobunaga shot me've yet to heal.

00:09:25.190 --> 00:09:26.720
Your back...

00:09:26.810 --> 00:09:27.890
Even if I heal up,

00:09:27.980 --> 00:09:32.640
there's no knowin' if I can wield my
sword in the Jigen Style like before.

00:09:32.730 --> 00:09:34.650
I see.

00:09:34.740 --> 00:09:35.900
You'll be fine.

00:09:35.990 --> 00:09:39.070
It's all about your fighting
spirit, Gramps. Your fighting spirit.

00:09:39.780 --> 00:09:41.650
I know that.

00:09:41.740 --> 00:09:46.530
Then, the men currently fighting
and protecting Satsuma are...

00:09:46.620 --> 00:09:49.580
The folks who drifted here to Satsuma.

00:09:49.670 --> 00:09:52.410
Folks driven from their
lands by Oda 'n Toyotomi,

00:09:52.500 --> 00:09:54.240
who've got nowhere left to go.

00:09:54.340 --> 00:09:56.500
So they fight like there's no tomorrow.

00:09:56.590 --> 00:09:59.210
Gramps' tactics are awesome, you know!

00:09:59.300 --> 00:10:01.840
Everyone's growing stronger real fast!

00:10:01.930 --> 00:10:03.760
I'm the strongest, though.

00:10:03.850 --> 00:10:08.220
I see, so you lead from the rear.

00:10:08.310 --> 00:10:14.730
But we're in no shape to
consider joinin' forces with ya.

00:10:14.820 --> 00:10:17.400
The Tiger o' Kai's tryin'
to attack Toyotomi 'n Mori

00:10:17.490 --> 00:10:20.730
from both the east 'n the west, I reckon?

00:10:20.820 --> 00:10:22.690
It is as you have inferred.

00:10:22.780 --> 00:10:25.990
With our motley crew,
we've got our hands full

00:10:26.080 --> 00:10:29.660
just protectin' this southernmost
tip from Toyotomi's influence.

00:10:30.920 --> 00:10:32.420
Lord Shimazu,

00:10:32.500 --> 00:10:36.210
my number one objective
in being sent to this land

00:10:36.300 --> 00:10:40.010
is to reverse this situation.

00:10:40.090 --> 00:10:42.080
Though, on our way here,

00:10:42.180 --> 00:10:47.420
I lost half of the troops that were
entrusted to me at Itsukushima...

00:10:47.520 --> 00:10:51.350
I would first ask that you
add us to the army of Satsuma.

00:10:51.440 --> 00:10:55.230
What's the main force o'
Takeda gonna do without ya?

00:10:55.320 --> 00:10:58.650
My lord has said that he
will not act until all is set.

00:10:58.740 --> 00:11:00.600
Is that right?

00:11:00.700 --> 00:11:03.730
Gramps, this guy's pretty strong.

00:11:03.830 --> 00:11:05.740
He's about second strongest after me.

00:11:05.830 --> 00:11:07.610
That's reassurin' to hear!

00:11:08.960 --> 00:11:10.910
I understand.

00:11:11.000 --> 00:11:18.540
I reckon we'll take the Tiger o' Kai
up on his kind offer then.

00:11:18.630 --> 00:11:20.590
I look forward to my time with you.

00:11:23.930 --> 00:11:25.590
Hey, you.

00:11:25.680 --> 00:11:27.260
Come join us.

00:11:27.350 --> 00:11:29.890
It's got to be boring just watching.

00:11:29.980 --> 00:11:31.090
You, too.

00:11:31.190 --> 00:11:33.850
And you and you and you and you, too.

00:11:33.940 --> 00:11:36.900
A-Agreed. Then...

00:11:47.330 --> 00:11:49.360
This spear...

00:11:49.450 --> 00:11:55.580
Am I truly worthy of
continuing to wield this spear?

00:11:57.590 --> 00:11:59.670
My lord...

00:11:59.760 --> 00:12:04.550
Though I promised to
reinforce the Satsuma Army,

00:12:04.640 --> 00:12:06.590
I am uncertain.

00:12:06.680 --> 00:12:08.930
Robbing the innocent
people of peace and order,

00:12:09.020 --> 00:12:11.260
this world of war continues
to oppress the elderly,

00:12:11.350 --> 00:12:15.890
the helpless women,
and those of tender age.

00:12:15.980 --> 00:12:18.600
How many more foes must we lay low

00:12:18.690 --> 00:12:24.310
for the world of peace
that you pursue to arrive?

00:12:26.070 --> 00:12:30.190
How many allies must we lose?

00:12:32.410 --> 00:12:36.200
Olease tell me, my lord!

00:12:40.170 --> 00:12:44.010
Hang in there, Gramps.
They'll be roasted up in just a bit.

00:12:44.090 --> 00:12:46.080
You've got my guarantee, they'll be tasty!

00:12:46.180 --> 00:12:48.880
Ah, it's startin' to smell good.

00:12:48.970 --> 00:12:51.380
You are so kind, Master Musashi.

00:12:51.470 --> 00:12:53.010
It is as if you are father and son--

00:12:53.100 --> 00:12:54.510
You moron.

00:12:54.600 --> 00:12:56.850
I'm doing this so when
the gramps gets all better,

00:12:56.940 --> 00:13:00.270
I don't have to waste any
time beating the crap out of him.

00:13:00.360 --> 00:13:01.860
Goodness...

00:13:01.940 --> 00:13:04.650
Man, it was so disappointing.

00:13:04.740 --> 00:13:06.820
I came all this way to Satsuma,
because I heard stories

00:13:06.910 --> 00:13:10.900
that the strongest gramps in all
the land of the rising sun was here.

00:13:10.990 --> 00:13:13.160
It could not have been helped.

00:13:13.250 --> 00:13:17.870
I am told Oda launched a sneak
attack while Lord Shimazu was away.

00:13:17.960 --> 00:13:19.370
With every last ally routed already--

00:13:19.460 --> 00:13:21.080
Okey-dokey, they're roasted.

00:13:21.170 --> 00:13:22.330
You eat, too.

00:13:22.420 --> 00:13:26.590
A-Ah, I am much obliged.

00:13:26.680 --> 00:13:28.090
Here you go, Gramps.

00:13:28.180 --> 00:13:31.640
Get well soon and get beat up by me!

00:13:34.100 --> 00:13:37.430
I truly owe ya my life.

00:13:37.520 --> 00:13:42.440
I'd better eat well 'n get
beat up in spectacular fashion!

00:13:42.530 --> 00:13:43.640
Ooh!

00:13:45.900 --> 00:13:49.320
I was in Aki at the time.

00:13:49.410 --> 00:13:53.740
Just like how ya folks
got the eastern lands allied,

00:13:53.830 --> 00:13:56.870
I wanted to get the western lands together

00:13:56.960 --> 00:14:01.670
'n have Lord Mori Motonari
take command, but...

00:14:01.750 --> 00:14:04.750
What I desire is peace for Aki.

00:14:04.840 --> 00:14:08.710
What becomes of other
lands is of no concern to me.

00:14:08.800 --> 00:14:11.590
Olace your trust lightly in others

00:14:11.680 --> 00:14:13.970
and you will quickly find
yourself beheaded in your sleep.

00:14:14.970 --> 00:14:19.430
Lord Mori kept me there to buy time

00:14:19.520 --> 00:14:21.730
'n had Oda dancin' pretty to his tune,

00:14:21.810 --> 00:14:25.900
gettin' him to attack Kyushu
before the Inland Sea o' Seto.

00:14:25.990 --> 00:14:27.240
Unbelievable...

00:14:27.320 --> 00:14:29.690
In our battle against the
Devil King at Mount Azuchi,

00:14:29.780 --> 00:14:31.860
he was a general who fought on our side.

00:14:31.950 --> 00:14:34.820
As a warrior, such conduct is...

00:14:34.910 --> 00:14:36.740
No.

00:14:36.830 --> 00:14:38.990
Not many can be so thoroughly steadfast

00:14:39.080 --> 00:14:43.870
in seein' only to the
good o' his own domain.

00:14:43.960 --> 00:14:53.680
Ya can say he's got a firm sense o'
honor that transcends good 'n evil.

00:14:53.760 --> 00:14:56.880
Honor that transcends good and evil...

00:14:56.980 --> 00:15:03.100
I canna think that man'll join
forces with Toyotomi just like that.

00:15:03.190 --> 00:15:07.310
Might be he's got some
outrageous plot up his sleeve.

00:15:09.490 --> 00:15:12.600
Mori Motonari...

00:15:24.170 --> 00:15:26.500
Whoops, my bad.

00:15:26.590 --> 00:15:31.880
At least with this, Toshi and Matsu
won't have to go to war for now.

00:15:31.970 --> 00:15:33.670
Yumekichi.

00:15:33.760 --> 00:15:35.550
Let's have something
good to eat on our way home.

00:15:37.180 --> 00:15:41.420
I'll go to the castle again before
Toyotomi makes another move.

00:15:41.520 --> 00:15:45.760
If talking to him doesn't work,
I'll just have to lay into him.

00:15:45.860 --> 00:15:47.690
It'll be fine.

00:15:47.780 --> 00:15:51.230
That's how we've always done things.

00:15:51.320 --> 00:15:54.980
He wasn't like that to begin...

00:15:55.070 --> 00:15:56.360
Yumekichi?

00:15:56.450 --> 00:15:58.660
Yumekichi!

00:15:58.750 --> 00:16:02.360
Yumekichi! Come on, Yumekichi!

00:16:02.460 --> 00:16:03.910
Oh, sorry.

00:16:09.510 --> 00:16:12.790
Is there something on my face?

00:16:18.640 --> 00:16:20.260
A friend of yours?

00:16:22.850 --> 00:16:24.810
You are a strange young man.

00:16:39.240 --> 00:16:41.200
I'm sorry, Yumekichi.

00:16:43.750 --> 00:16:47.040
I guess I must've made you worry a lot.

00:16:55.010 --> 00:16:56.620
A friend of yours?

00:17:05.100 --> 00:17:07.390
Bastard! Let Hideyoshi go!

00:17:15.820 --> 00:17:20.160
Hideyoshi! Hideyoshi!

00:17:20.240 --> 00:17:22.150
Why the anger?

00:17:22.250 --> 00:17:25.080
You were the ones who
brought the battle to us.

00:17:25.160 --> 00:17:26.670
I find it incomprehensible.

00:17:26.750 --> 00:17:29.240
Truly incomprehensible.

00:17:29.340 --> 00:17:30.840
We didn't mean for it to be a battle...

00:17:30.920 --> 00:17:34.160
We were just looking
to test our strength.

00:17:34.260 --> 00:17:38.840
Keiji... run...

00:17:38.930 --> 00:17:41.840
You boys may not know this yet,

00:17:41.930 --> 00:17:45.720
but if you lack strength, you cannot
protest, no matter what is done to you.

00:17:45.810 --> 00:17:48.180
That is the truth of this world.

00:17:48.270 --> 00:17:50.680
Death is a given in battles.

00:17:50.770 --> 00:17:55.230
And he is about to learn that firsthand.

00:17:55.320 --> 00:17:57.450
This guy's bad news...

00:18:01.240 --> 00:18:03.570
I'm begging you!

00:18:03.660 --> 00:18:05.700
Show him mercy!

00:18:05.790 --> 00:18:08.750
Please, don't kill him!

00:18:10.840 --> 00:18:12.950
I'll do anything! So...

00:18:15.920 --> 00:18:18.410
Olease forgive him!

00:18:18.510 --> 00:18:20.090
He's...

00:18:20.180 --> 00:18:22.130
...my friend!

00:18:26.680 --> 00:18:28.720
I merely did my duty as an adult

00:18:28.810 --> 00:18:33.270
in dealing with you children who
are ignorant of the ways of the world.

00:18:39.360 --> 00:18:42.490
Hideyoshi, you alive?

00:18:47.790 --> 00:18:50.330
Guess we screwed up...

00:18:50.420 --> 00:18:53.580
Even in testing our strength, we
better choose our opponents wisely,

00:18:53.670 --> 00:18:55.800
or it'll be no laughing matter.

00:19:03.180 --> 00:19:04.790
There they are!

00:19:06.430 --> 00:19:07.590
Crap.

00:19:07.680 --> 00:19:09.260
It's those guys from the other day.

00:19:09.350 --> 00:19:11.260
You cursed brats!

00:19:11.350 --> 00:19:14.350
I shall not be forgiving you! No, sir!

00:19:14.440 --> 00:19:16.400
Chief Abbot Kennyo may
have laughed and forgiven you,

00:19:16.480 --> 00:19:20.570
but our guts... I mean,
our blood is still boiling!

00:19:20.660 --> 00:19:23.490
We're sorry, fighting
monks of Hongwanji!

00:19:23.570 --> 00:19:25.910
We got a little too carried away.

00:19:25.990 --> 00:19:27.240
See? I'm sorry.

00:19:27.330 --> 00:19:31.740
If you want, we'll go
see Kennyo now and...

00:19:31.830 --> 00:19:33.920
Hideyoshi?

00:19:34.000 --> 00:19:36.870
Strength...

00:19:36.960 --> 00:19:40.420
Those who have it
and those who do not...

00:19:43.470 --> 00:19:48.090
What a weak being am I!

00:19:55.190 --> 00:19:56.770
Hideyoshi, don't!

00:19:56.860 --> 00:19:58.470
Hideyoshi!

00:20:05.990 --> 00:20:08.480
To lack strength is criminal.

00:20:08.580 --> 00:20:13.910
Nothing is within grasp for
those who have no strength!

00:20:14.000 --> 00:20:17.460
I will acquire strength!

00:20:25.800 --> 00:20:27.760
Magnificent craftsmanship.

00:20:27.850 --> 00:20:29.840
Otenta Mitsuyo.

00:20:29.930 --> 00:20:33.020
Truly, a sublime sword.

00:20:33.100 --> 00:20:35.430
This is most generous indeed.

00:20:35.520 --> 00:20:38.600
I have no need of it.

00:20:38.690 --> 00:20:40.020
I see.

00:20:40.110 --> 00:20:43.520
Swords are superfluous
on your road to supremacy.

00:20:43.610 --> 00:20:47.820
Your strength depends on no object.
That is to be respected.

00:20:47.910 --> 00:20:51.900
We're glad if you're
pleased by it, Lord Matsunaga.

00:20:52.000 --> 00:20:55.160
We'd like you to think of it
as a show of our good faith.

00:20:55.250 --> 00:20:57.790
Hanbei, I will leave the rest to you.

00:20:57.880 --> 00:20:58.830
Certainly.

00:21:01.960 --> 00:21:05.080
Well, now. Naturally, I knew his name,

00:21:05.180 --> 00:21:10.140
but have I met your lord
somewhere at some point in the past?

00:21:12.020 --> 00:21:15.130
That's the list of the remuneration
you will receive upon success.

00:21:18.980 --> 00:21:20.100
Oh-ho...

00:21:20.190 --> 00:21:23.730
Such being the case, we would
like for you to intercept Date's force,

00:21:23.820 --> 00:21:25.950
which is headed for Osaka.

00:21:27.700 --> 00:21:30.690
Right around then, having entered Owari,

00:21:30.790 --> 00:21:34.900
the Date Army found their camp
surrounded by an unknown force.

00:21:35.000 --> 00:21:36.530
Damn, when did they get here?

00:21:36.620 --> 00:21:38.410
D-Do you think they're the Toyotomi?

00:21:39.460 --> 00:21:42.920
They're bandits, Number One!

00:21:43.010 --> 00:21:44.920
They've got some nerve.

00:21:45.010 --> 00:21:50.130
Let's just see what they
can manage to take from us.

00:21:55.310 --> 00:21:58.020
Wh-What the hell is
that humongous weapon?

00:21:58.100 --> 00:21:59.090
Isn't that...

00:21:59.190 --> 00:22:01.930
...a ship's anchor?

00:22:02.020 --> 00:22:04.860
Sorry, fellas.

00:22:04.940 --> 00:22:09.400
I think we're gonna need to
borrow your horses for a bit.

00:23:41.670 --> 00:23:43.870
My name is Toyotomi Hideyoshi.

00:23:43.960 --> 00:23:46.250
If you truly fear for this country,

00:23:46.340 --> 00:23:47.200
gather to me once again next time!

00:23:48.840 --> 00:23:51.710
Nothing is beyond my grasp!

00:23:51.800 --> 00:23:53.010
I will not let this country
fall to ruin as long as I am here.
